/target
/node_modules
/dist
.DS_Store
/src-tauri/gen
/perf/results
/perf/corpus/generated
/perf/corpus/rendered
/perf/harness/node_modules
*.trace
*.svg
# …except the two that are *source*, not output. `website/.gitignore` re-includes
# the favicon by the same trick; this one is the macOS app icon's grid, and
# without it a fresh clone could not regenerate `icon.icns`.
!/src-tauri/icons/macos.svg
token_expiry.md

# agent worktrees, transient
/.claude/worktrees

# The private working notes — bongofongo/dreamd-notes, cloned here as an
# independent repo rather than a submodule, since a submodule would publish a
# pointer to a private repo in a public tree. Nothing tracked here may depend
# on it existing: a fresh clone has no notes/ and must still build and test.
/notes

# One machine's perf numbers, and they live in notes/perf-baseline.json now.
# Ignored rather than merely absent so that `./perf/run.sh deep --update-baseline`
# in a clone without notes/ leaves a usable local reference instead of a file
# waiting to be committed back into the public tree.
/perf/baseline.json
